OL,3,GNEWSABus travel is changing in the West
OL,4,AMidlands - what will it mean for you?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus services in the West Midlands
OL,7,Fconurbation are to be brought back into
OL,8,Fpublic control for the first time in 40
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FThe region's mayor Richard Parker said
OL,12,Fthe West Midlands Combined Authority
OL,13,F(WMCA) would acquire National Express's
OL,14,FWest Midlands bus operation as part of
OL,15,Fa move to franchise services. The model
OL,16,Fallows WMCA to have smaller companies
OL,17,Frunning individual services across the
OL,18,Fregion - and the say as to who they
OL,19,Fare.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
