OL,3,GNEWSABus travel is changing in the West
OL,4,AMidlands - what will it mean for you?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is backing
OL,7,Fwhat he called a "bold move" and the
OL,8,F"biggest act of public control" since
OL,9,Fhe came into office earlier this
OL,10,Fsummer. Parker said it would protect
OL,11,Fbus routes and jobs.
OL,13,FBut what does this mean for the
OL,14,Fpassenger and how will things change?
